WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.350
- I don't think that people
would be happy with us

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.770
if we don't at least
mention "American Idol,"

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.950
and I actually find this amazing.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.920
Is it true that you
almost didn't audition?

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.240
- It was kinda like once
things started taking off,

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:17.170
and then the thought of me
going to Hollywood by myself,

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.280
and I'd never been on a plane before.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.840
It was very unlike me to just go for it,

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.360
and it was scary,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.007
so I definitely had a moment
of, "What am I doing?"

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.930
It's easier to stay home,

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:36.350
but I wouldn't be doing
anything I'm doing now.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.550
- [Kelly] Yeah, exactly.

